<title>RUSSIA: FIGURE SKATING-BAILEYS CUP OF RUSSIA SECOND DAY RESULTS.</title>
<headline>FIGURE SKATING-BAILEYS CUP OF RUSSIA SECOND DAY RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>ST PETERSBURG, Russia 1996-12-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of the</p>
<p>second day of the Baileys Cup of Russia, the sixth and the last</p>
<p>qualifying event of the ISU Champions Series, on Friday:</p>
<p>Pairs, final results:</p>
<p>1. Mandy Wotzel/Ingo Steuer (Germany)	     2.0</p>
<p>2. Marina Eltsova/Andrei Bushkov (Russia)	 2.5</p>
<p>3. Oksana Kazakova/Artur Dmitriev (Russia)	4.5</p>
<p>4. Shelby Lyons/Brian Wells (U.S.)		  6.0</p>
